        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute the Merkle root for a batch of artifact references. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Artifacts are sorted by (adapter_id, version) before hashing to ensure a deterministic root regardless of insertion order.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>artifacts</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Non-empty batch of artifact references. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>64-char lowercase hex SHA-256 Merkle root. </para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="exception"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>std::invalid_argument</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>if <computeroutput>artifacts</computeroutput> is empty. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
