        <briefdescription>
<para>Generate a membership proof for a specific artifact within a batch. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Leaves are identified by the composite key (adapter_id, version) to unambiguously locate the correct leaf when multiple versions of the same adapter appear in a batch.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>artifacts</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The complete batch used to build the tree. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>adapter_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Adapter identifier of the artifact to prove. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>version</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Version string of the artifact to prove. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Populated proof struct, or nullopt if (adapter_id, version) is not in the batch. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
